            <div xml:id="d801">

                <pb facs="0956" n="944" sameAs="frus:frus1943v03/pg944"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">701.0090/3123a: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Switzerland</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Harrison</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-11-05">November 5,
                        1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2726. American interests Far East—repatriation. The United States Government
                    would like to make another exchange with the Japanese Government to cover 1500
                    Americans for 1500 Japanese. Will you please present the matter to the attention
                    of the Japanese Government and advise Department of their attitude. If their
                    reply is favorable it might be possible for the <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Gripsholm</hi> to leave New York about February 1.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stettinius</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
